{"id":"121f27eb674c2890","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-well-founded-gl.md","title":"Well-founded Frames for GL","display":"prop-well-founded-gl — Well-founded Frames for GL","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-well-founded-gl","aliases":["89-prop-well-founded-gl"],"display":"prop-well-founded-gl — Well-founded Frames for GL","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-well-founded-gl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-well-founded-gl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-well-founded-gl — Well-founded Frames for GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)\\)</span> is a Kripke frame and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\;(\\mathcal F\\models A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\;(\\mathcal F\\models A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span> : GL框架 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> : 可达关系</li>\n<li>逆良基传递框架验证GL (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9eaa23de86feec90\" href=\"?note=9eaa23de86feec90\" title=\"89-df-well-founded\">89-df-well-founded</a>)</li>\n<li>GL语义的关键性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathc